    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点5：离散系统双零法状态变量求解",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            551,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考虑初始状态矢量为 $x(0)$ ， $k = 0$ 接入激励的因果系统，对其状态方程和输出方程分别取单边 $z$ 变换，有",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            118,
            850,
            165
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} z \\boldsymbol {X} (z) - z \\boldsymbol {x} (0) = \\boldsymbol {A} \\boldsymbol {X} (z) + \\boldsymbol {B} \\boldsymbol {F} (z) ① \\\\ \\boldsymbol {Y} (z) = \\boldsymbol {C} \\boldsymbol {X} (z) + \\boldsymbol {D} \\boldsymbol {F} (z) ④ \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            174,
            655,
            219
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式中 $X(z)$ 、 $F(z)$ 、 $Y(z)$ 分别是 $x(n)$ 、 $f(n)$ 、 $y(n)$ 的单边z变换。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            229,
            692,
            248
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对①式移项得",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            256,
            280,
            275
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(z I - A) X (z) = z x (0) + B F (z)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            363,
            284,
            633,
            303
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "等号两边左乘 $(zI - A)^{-1}$ , 得",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            309,
            406,
            326
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol {X} (z) = (z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A}) ^ {- 1} z \\boldsymbol {x} (0) + (z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A}) ^ {- 1} \\boldsymbol {B} \\boldsymbol {F} (z) ②\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            290,
            337,
            702,
            356
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "为了方便，定义",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            363,
            292,
            381
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol {\\Phi} (z) \\stackrel {d e f} {=} (z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A}) ^ {- 1} z\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            403,
            384,
            598,
            418
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "可称为状态方程矩阵[注意与连续系统中的状态方程矩阵 $\\Phi(s)$ 的区别]。于是可以将②式简写为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            422,
            850,
            468
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\pmb {X} (z) = \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {x} (0) + z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B} \\pmb {F} (z) ③\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            476,
            665,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对③式取逆z变换，得状态矢量的解为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            502,
            489,
            521
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\pmb {x} (n) = \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} [ \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {x} (0) ] + \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} [ z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B} \\pmb {F} (z) ] = \\pmb {x} _ {z i} (k) + \\pmb {x} _ {z s} (k)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            215,
            530,
            779,
            551
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式中",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            558,
            193,
            575
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r} \\pmb {x} _ {z i} (n) = \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} [ \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {x} (0) ] \\\\ \\pmb {x} _ {z s} (n) = \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} [ z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B F} (z) ] \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            366,
            586,
            630,
            632
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "分别是状态矢量的零输入解和零状态解。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            640,
            505,
            657
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "将③式代入④式可得输出的象函数为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            665,
            482,
            684
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\pmb {Y} (z) = \\pmb {C} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {x} (0) + C z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) B \\pmb {F} (z) + D \\pmb {F} (z)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            292,
            695,
            702,
            713
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对上式取逆z变换，可求出系统的响应为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            720,
            505,
            737
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\pmb {y} (k) = \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} [ \\pmb {C} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {x} (0) ] + \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} \\bigl \\{[ \\pmb {C} z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B} + \\pmb {D} ] \\pmb {F} (z) \\bigr \\}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            255,
            747,
            739,
            768
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "容易看出，上式第一项是系统的零输入响应矢量 $y_{zi}(n)$ ，第二项是系统的零状态响应矢量 $y_{zs}(n)$ ，即",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            776,
            848,
            822
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r} \\pmb {y} _ {z i} (n) = \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} [ \\pmb {C} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {x} (0) ] \\\\ \\pmb {y} _ {z s} (n) = \\mathcal {Z} ^ {- 1} \\big [ (\\pmb {C} \\pmb {z} ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B} + \\pmb {D}) \\pmb {F} (z) \\big ] \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            831,
            665,
            878
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "DF免费QQ群615698143\nB站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            0,
