    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 29: 已知某离散因果系统的状态方程和输出方程分别为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            665,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r} \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} x _ {1} (n + 1) \\\\ x _ {2} (n + 1) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c} 0 & 1 \\\\ - 6 & 5 \\end{array} \\right] \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} x _ {1} (n) \\\\ x _ {2} (n) \\end{array} \\right] + \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{array} \\right] f (n) \\\\ \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} y _ {1} (n) \\\\ y _ {2} (n) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c} 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & - 1 \\end{array} \\right] \\left[ \\begin{array}{c} x _ {1} (n) \\\\ x _ {2} (n) \\end{array} \\right] \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            315,
            110,
            680,
            189
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "初始状态为 $\\begin{bmatrix} x_1(0) \\\\ x_2(0) \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\end{bmatrix}$ ，激励 $f(n) = u(n)$ 。求状态方程的解和系统的输出。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            193,
            826,
            230
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "夢馬考研",
        "bbox": [
            425,
            502,
            600,
            539
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "DF免费QQ群615698143B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            0,
            9,
