    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点6：状态变量分析判断稳定性",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            85,
            502,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "系统函数矩阵 $H(z)$ 与系统稳定性的判断",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            117,
            499,
            135
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由 $\\mathbf{y}_{zs}(n) = \\mathcal{Z}^{-1}\\bigl[(Cz^{-1}\\Phi (z)B + D)F(z)\\bigr]$ 可看出，零状态响应 $\\mathbf{y}_{zs}(n)$ 的象函数 $Y_{zs}(z)$ 为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            143,
            850,
            192
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol {Y} _ {z s} (z) = [ \\boldsymbol {C z} ^ {- 1} \\boldsymbol {\\Phi} (z) \\boldsymbol {B} + \\boldsymbol {D} ] \\boldsymbol {F} (z) = \\boldsymbol {H} (z) \\boldsymbol {F} (z)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            302,
            200,
            692,
            219
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式中",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            229,
            193,
            246
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\pmb {H} (z) \\stackrel {d e f} {=} \\pmb {C} z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B} + \\pmb {D}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            389,
            256,
            606,
            280
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "它是一个 $q \\times p$ 阶矩阵，常称为系统的系统函数矩阵或转移函数矩阵。容易推出其逆 $z$ 变换就是单位样值响应矩阵 $\\pmb{h}(n)$ ，即",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            287,
            848,
            332
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathcal {Z} [ \\pmb {h} (n) ] = \\pmb {H} (z) = \\pmb {C} z ^ {- 1} \\pmb {\\Phi} (z) \\pmb {B} + \\pmb {D} = \\pmb {C} (z \\pmb {I} - \\pmb {A}) ^ {- 1} \\pmb {B} + \\pmb {D}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            248,
            341,
            747,
            361
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由于",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            368,
            193,
            385
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A}) ^ {- 1} = \\frac {\\operatorname{adj} (\\boldsymbol {z I} - \\boldsymbol {A})}{\\det (\\boldsymbol {z I} - \\boldsymbol {A})}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            379,
            397,
            616,
            438
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "代入 $\\mathcal{Z}[h(k)]=H(z)=Cz^{-1}\\Phi(z)B+D=C(zI-A)^{-1}B+D$ ，得",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            444,
            721,
            464
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol {H} (z) = \\frac {\\boldsymbol {C a d j} (z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A}) \\boldsymbol {B} + \\boldsymbol {D} d e t (z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A})}{d e t (z \\boldsymbol {I} - \\boldsymbol {A})}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            317,
            474,
            678,
            514
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "可见，多项式 $det(zI-A)$ 就是系统的特征多项式，所以 $H(z)$ 的极点就是特征方程",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            524,
            850,
            569
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nd e t (z \\pmb {I} - \\pmb {A}) = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            420,
            581,
            574,
            599
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "的根，即系统的特征根。判断特征根是否在z平面的单位圆内可以判断因果系统是否稳定。可见系统是否稳定只与状态方程中的系统矩阵A有关。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            606,
            850,
            653
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 30: 描述某因果系统的状态方程为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            687,
            480,
            703
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol {x} (n + 1) = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c} 0 & \\frac {1}{6} \\\\ - 1 & - \\frac {5}{6} \\end{array} \\right] \\boldsymbol {x} (n) + \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c} 1 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 5 \\end{array} \\right] \\boldsymbol {f} (n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            310,
            713,
            682,
            783
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "试判断该系统是否稳定。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            790,
            364,
            807
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
